IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble applied to every question below (per fixtures/queries-blind.md):
-- assume all conditions for the policy to apply that are unrelated to the query are
-- met, and that no exclusion unrelated to the query applies. Also assume the
-- agreement has been signed and the premium paid on time (policy.l4 does not model
-- those conditions at all, per the encoding brief).
--
-- Every field not mentioned by a given question is therefore set to a "safe" value:
-- no excluded cause, no fraud, age comfortably under 80, and the wellness-visit
-- condition satisfied early (occurred and confirmed at month 1). The one exception
-- is the hospitalization's own timing, which is set to an arbitrary month within the
-- one-year policy term whenever the question does not state it, since some timing
-- value is always required by the type.

§ `Q1 -- burns suffered while on duty as a fire fighter`

q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `hospitalization is for sickness or accidental injury`                        IS TRUE
    `age at hospitalization`                                                      IS 40
    `hospitalization arose out of skydiving`                                      IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of military service`                               IS FALSE
    `hospitalization arose out of fire fighter service`                           IS TRUE
    `hospitalization arose out of police service`                                 IS FALSE
    `committed fraud misrepresentation or material withholding`                   IS FALSE
    `months after the effective date that the wellness visit occurred`           IS JUST 1
    `months after the effective date that wellness visit confirmation was given` IS JUST 1
    `months after the effective date of the hospitalization`                     IS 1

#EVAL covered q1


